        {
          "id": "docx-n5-6c9c53c48f15d0b605d395db",
          "alias": "角色换上轻便背心和短裤,懒散地斜躺在蓝色沙发上,一条腿伸展,另一条腿随意弯起。她靠着沙发扶手,轻松地吃着冰棒,脸上带着被暑气耗尽精力后的满足与慵懒。茶几上放着杂",
          "prompt": "构图分为三层：前景的原设服装形成醒目的晾晒展示,中景由玻璃门框构成画中画,后景聚焦沙发上正在避暑的角色。强烈的奶油金色阳光照亮阳台和衣物,室内覆盖清凉的灰蓝与薄荷绿色环境光,玻璃表面带有轻微反射。整体明亮、松弛、生活化而幽默,战斗服在晒太阳,角色本人也在放假的夏日反差。1.5::bright creamy afternoon sunlight,sun-drenched balcony,warm directional daylight::,1.5::cool shaded living room,soft gray-blue ambient light,warm-cool separation::,1.4::sunlight passing through glass door,restrained glass reflection,soft reflected light::,1.4::clear cast shadows from clothesline,luminous fabric edges,gentle interior shadow gradients::,1.3::balanced exposure,preserved highlight detail,readable indoor shadows,subtle atmospheric warmth::1.5::masterpiece,best quality,amazing quality,very aesthetic::,1.5::highres,ultra detailed,professional anime illustration,polished artwork,clean lineart::,1.5::cinematic environmental composition,clear visual hierarchy,coherent perspective,balanced framing::,1.4::natural lounging pose,accurate anatomy,expressive face,believable body weight::,1.4::detailed hanging costume,detailed fabric folds,refined clothing accessories,realistic clothes hangers::,1.4::detailed domestic interior,polished furniture textures,transparent glass,subtle reflections::,1.4::refined sunlight and shadow,cohesive warm-cool color harmony,controlled exposure::,1.3::atmospheric depth,layered foreground and background,crisp subject focus,visual storytelling::,1.3::slice-of-life illustration,charming comedic timing,lived-in environment,professional finish::",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_14961_角色换上轻便背心和短裤,懒散地斜躺在蓝色沙发上,.jpg",
          "tags": [],
