        {
          "id": "codex-suozhang_nai5_r18-0063",
          "alias": "夏日洗衣后晾晒缩在家里",
          "prompt": "炎热的夏日下午,阳台上只有一只简洁的晾衣架。架上晾晒着角色脱下的一件湿透的战斗服、一双湿透的分离袖套 、一只带红色蝴蝶结的黑色内裤。彼此留有清晰间隔,镜头从阳台望向室内。布料被微弱热风轻轻吹动。玻璃推拉门位于中景,将明亮炎热的阳台与清凉安静的客厅分隔开。透过玻璃门,可以看到角色穿着轻便家居服,懒散地躺在沙发上吃冰棒。\n角色换上轻便背心和短裤,懒散地斜躺在蓝色沙发上,一条腿伸展,另一条腿随意弯起。她靠着沙发扶手,轻松地吃着冰棒,脸上带着被暑气耗尽精力后的满足与慵懒。茶几上放着杂志和生活用品,风扇在后方缓慢转动,阳台角落可见空调外机与被阳光照亮的绿植。\n构图分为三层：前景的原设服装形成醒目的晾晒展示,中景由玻璃门框构成画中画,后景聚焦沙发上正在避暑的角色。强烈的奶油金色阳光照亮阳台和衣物,室内覆盖清凉的灰蓝与薄荷绿色环境光,玻璃表面带有轻微反射。整体明亮、松弛、生活化而幽默,战斗服在晒太阳,角色本人也在放假的夏日反差。1.5::bright creamy afternoon sunlight,sun-drenched balcony,warm directional daylight::,1.5::cool shaded living room,soft gray-blue ambient light,warm-cool separation::,1.4::sunlight passing through glass door,restrained glass reflection,soft reflected light::,1.4::clear cast shadows from clothesline,luminous fabric edges,gentle interior shadow gradients::,1.3::balanced exposure,preserved highlight detail,readable indoor shadows,subtle atmospheric warmth::1.5::masterpiece,best quality,amazing quality,very aesthetic::,1.5::highres,ultra detailed,professional anime illustration,polished artwork,clean lineart::,1.5::cinematic environmental composition,clear visual hierarchy,coherent perspective,balanced framing::,1.4::natural lounging pose,accurate anatomy,expressive face,believable body weight::,1.4::detailed hanging costume,detailed fabric folds,refined clothing accessories,realistic clothes hangers::,1.4::detailed domestic interior,polished furniture textures,transparent glass,subtle reflections::,1.4::refined sunlight and shadow,cohesive warm-cool color harmony,controlled exposure::,1.3::atmospheric depth,layered foreground and background,crisp subject focus,visual storytelling::,1.3::slice-of-life illustration,charming comedic timing,lived-in environment,professional finish::",
          "description": "来源：所长N5色色NovelAI个人法典（合并版）；版本：2026.9.25\n\nhttps://novelai.quicktagcloud.com/?c=suozhang_nai5_r18&id=suozhang_nai5_r18-0063",
